sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Caller as 👤 Remote Caller (Cellular Line)
    participant Carrier as 📡 Mobile Carrier Network<br/>(Jio / Airtel VoLTE)
    participant Modem as 📱 Handset Baseband Modem<br/>(iQOO Z9 MT6878 Baseband)
