    Note over Caller,PC_Host: AI_CALL Phase 9.2 — Comprehensive Audio Architecture & Call Flow

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% 1. WHY STOCK ANDROID FAILS (THE CALLER-AUDIO BREAKDOWN)
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
    Note over Caller,App: 1. Forensic Diagnosis: Why Remote Caller Hears Dead Silence on Stock Android
    Caller->>Carrier: Dials User Mobile Number
    Carrier->>Modem: Cellular VoLTE Call Arrival
    Modem->>Telecom: Telecom Framework notifies incoming call
    Telecom->>App: InCallService answers call
    App->>PC_Host: Relays call trigger / attempts audio playback
    PC_Host-->>App: Generates AI Response Text
    App->>App: AndroidTtsEngine synthesizes speech
    App->>Telecom: AudioTrack.write() with USAGE_VOICE_COMMUNICATION
    Telecom->>DSP: AudioPolicy routes PCM strictly to AUDIO_DEVICE_OUT_SPEAKER
    DSP->>DSP: Loudspeaker plays AI voice into the physical room
    
    critical Hardware Uplink Isolation & AEC Elimination
        Modem--xTelecom: [PERMISSION DENIED] VOICE_DOWNLINK blocked (requires CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT)
        Telecom--xModem: [NO USERSPACE ROUTE] Cannot inject AudioTrack into cellular TX modem buffer!
        DSP->>DSP: Hardware AEC identifies loudspeaker sound as acoustic echo & cancels it from mic
        Modem->>Carrier: Transmits filtered silence / background noise over VoLTE uplink
        Carrier->>Caller: 🔇 Remote Caller hears DEAD SILENCE (despite phone UI saying "AI HANDLED")
    end
    end

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% 2. VERIFIED SOLUTION: LINUX BLUETOOTH HFP BRIDGE
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(240, 255, 245)
    Note over Caller,PC_Host: 2. Verified Working Architecture: Linux Bluetooth HFP SCO Loopback
    Caller->>Carrier: Dials User Mobile Number
    Carrier->>Modem: Cellular VoLTE Call Arrival
    Modem->>Telecom: Incoming call alert
    Telecom->>App: InCallService detects call
    Telecom->>Modem: Routes call audio to Bluetooth SCO (ROUTE_BLUETOOTH)
    
    Note over Modem,Pi_Bridge: Bidirectional Synchronous eSCO Link Established (16kHz mSBC / 8kHz CVSD)
    Modem->>Pi_Bridge: Caller audio streamed over Bluetooth eSCO Downlink
    Pi_Bridge->>Pi_Bridge: BlueZ 5.65+ (Hands-Free profile) receives SCO packets
    Pi_Bridge->>Pi_Bridge: PipeWire ALSA capture device receives raw 16kHz PCM
    Pi_Bridge->>PC_Host: Streams caller PCM over USB Gadget (CDC-NCM) / LAN (<15ms latency)

    rect rgb(245, 245, 255)
    Note over PC_Host: Local PC AI Processing (100% English Offline):<br/>1. English ASR: faster-whisper base.en / SAPI 8.0 (~250-350ms)<br/>2. Deterministic Guardrail: Non-English/Telugu check (<1ms)<br/>3. Reasoning: Ollama qwen2.5:3b CPU inference (~1.2s)<br/>4. English TTS: SAPI5 David WAV synthesis (~130ms)
    end

    PC_Host->>Pi_Bridge: Returns synthesized English speech PCM buffer (<15ms)
    Pi_Bridge->>Pi_Bridge: PipeWire ALSA playback device receives audio
    Pi_Bridge->>Modem: Injects PCM into Bluetooth eSCO Microphone Uplink
    Modem->>Carrier: Baseband modem transmits Bluetooth mic stream directly to VoLTE RF uplink
    Carrier->>Caller: 🔊 Remote Caller clearly hears natural AI agent speech!
    end

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% 3. HUMAN TAKEOVER & SAFETY GUARDRAILS
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(255, 250, 235)
    Note over Caller,PC_Host: 3. Instant Manual Takeover & Disconnect Protection
    opt User Picks Up Phone to Talk Manually
        App->>Telecom: User presses "Take Over" button on phone UI
        Telecom->>Modem: Audio routing instantly switches from ROUTE_BLUETOOTH to ROUTE_EARPIECE
        Telecom->>Pi_Bridge: Tears down eSCO audio channel
        Caller->>Modem: Caller audio routed directly to user ear
        Note over Caller,Modem: User speaks normally with 0ms interruption; AI bridge automatically detaches.
    end
    opt Bluetooth Disconnection or PC Crash
        Pi_Bridge-xPC_Host: USB or LAN connection timeout (>3.0s)
        Pi_Bridge->>Modem: Sends HFP AT+CHUP (Hang Up) or plays local fallback chime
        Telecom->>Telecom: Auto-diverts audio back to handset earpiece
    end
    end
